    "shares": 14,
    "full_text": "Why are non-linear thinking, high-intelligence, high-energy individuals, fully channeled ADHD, and intense hyperfocus a supreme superpower in the new era? (Applicable to all fields, but especially Computer Science)\n1.\nLinear and trivial tasks are the ultimate motivation and dopamine killers for hyperactive, non-linear, and high-IQ minds.\nNow that AI handles these tedious chores, the playing field has opened up for work that strictly demands high energy and cognitive leaps.\n2.\nThe Power of Hyperfocus in Crisis Resolution:\nWhen the system hits a dead end—presenting challenges like manual mapping, memory manipulation, and binary payloads—an ordinary mind exhausts quickly. However, the Hyperfocus trait grants you the uncanny ability to lock onto a complex problem, dissect its deepest underlying layers, and refuse to resurface until the solution is found.\n3.\nSeeing Macro Patterns (Systemic Vision):\nHighly intelligent and energetic minds discover the interconnections and correlations between seemingly disconnected system components much faster. This is the exact systems thinking required to modularize large-scale projects.",
